cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Neon Forge in research, cite it as below."
title: "Neon Forge: parallel AI reverse-engineering system"
abstract: >-
  Neon Forge orchestrates three engines under one AI Meta-Manager: REA for
  probe-driven behavior extraction, Heretic for directional ablation of refusal
  directions, and OBLITERATUS for SVD/PCA geometry mapping and rank-k projection
  surgery. Every run is gated on capability preservation and activation drift,
  and reports artifacts rather than assertions.
type: software
authors:
